{"entries":[[718,"inquiéter","verb",5,"/ɛ̃.kje.te/","",[525,"Fr-inqui%C3%A9ter.ogg.mp3"],[["to worry","",["transitive"],[],[["Cette nouvelle m'inquiète.","This news worries me.",""]]],["to be worried, to worry","",["pronominal"],["s'en faire"],[["Ne t'inquiète pas!","Don't worry! (informal)",""],["Ne vous en inquiétez pas!","Don't worry about it. (formal)",""]]]],{"infinitive":"inquiéter","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"inquiétant","past_participle":"inquiété","present":["inquiète","inquiètes","inquiète","inquiétons","inquiétez","inquiètent"],"imperfect":["inquiétais","inquiétais","inquiétait","inquiétions","inquiétiez","inquiétaient"],"future":["inquièterai","inquièteras","inquiètera","inquièterons","inquièterez","inquièteront"],"conditional":["inquièterais","inquièterais","inquièterait","inquièterions","inquièteriez","inquièteraient"],"subjunctive":["inquiète","inquiètes","inquiète","inquiétions","inquiétiez","inquiètent"]},[],""],[1962,"inquiet","adjective",4,"/ɛ̃.kjɛ/","",[1578,"Fr-inquiet.ogg.mp3"],[["worried","",[],[],[]],["anxious","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inquiet","feminine":"inquiète","masculine_plural":"inquiets","feminine_plural":"inquiètes"},[],["Il a l'humeur inquiète.","Il est d'humeur inquiète.","La jalousie est une passion inquiète."]],[2551,"inquiétude","noun",4,"/ɛ̃.kje.tyd/","f",[2085,"Fr-inqui%C3%A9tude.ogg.mp3"],[["worry, concern, trepidation","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inquiétudes"},[],["Une inquiétude en bois de saule garnie de soigne.","— L'enfant dépérissait, la mère et la grand-mère se dévoraient d'inquiétude.","Ce malade a passé la nuit dans une grande inquiétude, dans de grandes inquiétudes."]],[4224,"inquiétant","adjective",4,"/ɛ̃.kje.tɑ̃/","",[3564,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-inqui%C3%A9tant.wav.mp3"],[["worrying, disturbing, disquieting","",[],["préoccupant","troublant","perturbant","tracassant","alarmant"],[]]],{"masculine":"inquiétant","feminine":"inquiétante","masculine_plural":"inquiétants","feminine_plural":"inquiétantes"},[],["Le coucher de soleil est d'un gris inquiétant et de gros nuages noirs s'accumulent vers l'occident.","Ce qui est inquiétant concernant les passages pour piétons de type zébra, c'est la fausse sécurité qu'ils procurent.","Le bruit du bombardement au-dessus de l'abri devient formidable. Les obus tombent sur la Chancellerie avec une précision inquiétante."]],[8735,"inquisition","noun",3,"/ɛ̃.ki.zi.sjɔ̃/","f",[7328,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-inquisition.wav.mp3"],[["inquisition","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inquisitions"},[],["D'aucuns dénoncent un tribunal populaire, un lynchage médiatique, une inquisition 2.0.","Les transferts internationaux étant ultraréglementés, si vous envoyez de l'argent ou en recevez, attendez-vous à subir l'inquisition du banquier."]],[12691,"inquisiteur","adjective",2,"/ɛ̃.ki.zi.tœʁ/","","",[["inquisitive, probing, prying","",[],[],[["un air inquisiteur","",""],["un regard inquisiteur","",""]]]],{"masculine":"inquisiteur","feminine":"inquisitrice","masculine_plural":"inquisiteurs","feminine_plural":"inquisitrices"},[],""],[12692,"inquisiteur","noun",2,"/ɛ̃.ki.zi.tœʁ/","m","",[["inquisitor","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inquisiteurs","feminine":"inquisitrice"},[],["Et quand la jeune femme lui demanda, le soir: « Comment le trouves-tu? » il répondit: « Cet homme-là, c'est un inquisiteur! Il doit être dangereux. »","Le roi vit dans cette mort un châtiment divin et l'inquisiteur Henri de Cologne en profita pour obtenir de lui l'application immédiate de la sanction."]],[19615,"inqualifiable","adjective",2,"/ɛ̃.ka.li.fjabl/","",[15710,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Penegal-inqualifiable.wav.mp3"],[["unspeakable, despicable, objectionable","",[],[],[]],["inappropriate, unacceptable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inqualifiable","masculine_plural":"inqualifiables"},[],["À l'instant, je me sens au milieu de nulle part. C'est une sensation de malaise indescriptible, un inconfort inqualifiable."]],[24227,"inquisitorial","adjective",1,"/ɛ̃.ki.zi.tɔ.ʁjal/","",[19565,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-inquisitorial.wav.mp3"],[["inquisitorial (all senses)","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inquisitorial","feminine":"inquisitoriale","masculine_plural":"inquisitoriaux","feminine_plural":"inquisitoriales"},[],["Pouvoir inquisitorial.","Tyrannie inquisitoriale.","Visites inquisitoriales."]],[61820,"inquestionnable","adjective",0,"","","",[["unquestionable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inquestionnable","masculine_plural":"inquestionnables"},[],""],[61821,"inquilin","adjective",0,"","","",[["inquilinous","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inquilin","feminine":"inquiline","masculine_plural":"inquilins","feminine_plural":"inquilines"},[],""],[61822,"inquilin","noun",0,"","m","",[["inquiline","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inquilins"},[],""],[61823,"inquilinisme","noun",0,"","m","",[["inquilinism","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inquilinismes"},[],["Dans un tel cas, l'inquilinisme est total."]],[61824,"inquisitif","adjective",0,"/ɛ̃.ki.zi.tif/","","",[["inquisitive","",["dated"],["inquisiteur"],[]]],{"masculine":"inquisitif","feminine":"inquisitive","masculine_plural":"inquisitifs","feminine_plural":"inquisitives"},[],""],[61825,"inquisitivement","adverb",0,"/ɛ̃.ki.zi.tiv.mɑ̃/","",[43242,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-inquisitivement.wav.mp3"],[["inquisitively","",[],[],[]]],{},[],""],[61826,"inquiètement","adverb",0,"/ɛ̃.kjɛt.mɑ̃/","",[43243,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-inqui%C3%A8tement.wav.mp3"],[["worriedly; anxiously","",[],[],[]]],{},[],["Cependant je cherchais des yeux, inquiètement, ce qui pouvait rappeler le passé.","Qu'avait-elle entendu de notre conversation ? Et je me remémorais inquiètement nos paroles.","Quels beaux yeux il levait vers moi ! qui cherchaient aussi inquiètement mon regard que mon regard cherchait le sien ; mais que je détournais aussitôt…"]]],"redirects":{"inqualifiables":[[19615,87]],"inquestionnables":[[61820,91]],"inquiets":[[1962,30]],"inquiline":[[61821,16]],"inquilines":[[61821,11]],"inquilinismes":[[61823,89]],"inquilins":[[61821,8